[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9481.429, "timestamp": "02:38:01", "text": "东西。自己用吧。所以，我当时是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9483.429, "timestamp": "02:38:03", "text": "好像太挑剔了。我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9485.99, "timestamp": "02:38:05", "text": "别在我身上浪费钱。甚至"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9489.27, "timestamp": "02:38:09", "text": "虽然我当时在做，但我心里想的是，是啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9495.99, "timestamp": "02:38:15", "text": "但人们还是会花一点钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9498.95, "timestamp": "02:38:18", "text": "当我获得会员资格时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9501.51, "timestamp": "02:38:21", "text": "每个人都接受了会员资格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9505.03, "timestamp": "02:38:25", "text": "这让我很高兴，所以我把它设为最低价。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9507.27, "timestamp": "02:38:27", "text": "可能的价格就像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9511.349, "timestamp": "02:38:31", "text": "30卢比，30或20卢比，我猜是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9513.03, "timestamp": "02:38:33", "text": "所以更确切地说，是我不知道你可以这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9516.71, "timestamp": "02:38:36", "text": "选择一下，比如要寄多少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9519.429, "timestamp": "02:38:39", "text": "创建一个会员等级，哦，有趣的 I 级"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9521.75, "timestamp": "02:38:41", "text": "我更改了等级金额。所以我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9524.469, "timestamp": "02:38:44", "text": "只保留一个层级，保持在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9526.07, "timestamp": "02:38:46", "text": "最低。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9529.27, "timestamp": "02:38:49", "text": "是的。所以如果他们这样做，对其他人来说就更容易了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9532.95, "timestamp": "02:38:52", "text": "想喜欢……嗯，该怎么称呼它呢？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9535.51, "timestamp": "02:38:55", "text": "赠送会员资格之类的东西。所以它会"}]